/></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li>AoE <a href=\"/page/Phantasmal_Killer\" title=\"Phantasmal Killer\">Phantasmal Killer</a> CL10</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Bottled_Fear.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Bottled_Fear.png/420px-Bottled_Fear.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"494\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Bottled_Fear.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A glass flask filled with writhing vapor. When it breaks on impact, nearby enemies are subjected to a <a href=\"/page/Phantasmal_Killer\" title=\"Phantasmal Killer\">Phantasmal Killer</a> effect. (Creates a phantasmal image of the most fearsome creature imaginable by forming the fears of the enemy's subconscious mind into something that its conscious mind can visualize. Enemies must make a Will save to disbelieve the spell and then a Fortitude save or die from fear. A successful Fortitude save still results in 3d6 damage.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><b>Bug: </b> Shows UMD Difficulty: 20 but does not actually need UMD.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201347\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3088/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20748/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5680/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n125.20%  138.244     41 Template:IO\n100.00%  110.417      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  110.417      1 -total\n 94.73%  104.596      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 44.93%   49.611      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 42.96%   47.435      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 41.34%   45.642      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 39.40%   43.508      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.88%   21.947      3 Template:Popup\n 18.79%   20.750      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:19620-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817201347 and revision id 668183. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
